    {
      "time": 1793218147.1141977,
      "id": "ca8b9a47-dbd8-4345-97b0-78a8bb07af7e",
      "body": "Done. Script created at `scripts/backup_project.py`.\n\n**What it does:**\n- Archives a source folder (default: `project/`) into a zip inside `backups/` (default)\n- Zip name: `YYYY-MM-DDTHH-MM-SS_Project_Backup.zip`\n- CLI flags: `--source` and `--backup-dir`\n\n**The deliberate bug** (line 29):\n```python\nos.makedirs(dest)  # no exist_ok=True\n```\nFirst run works fine \u2014 creates the `backups/` directory. Second run crashes with `FileExistsError` because the directory already exists and `exist_ok` was not set. Fix: `os.makedirs(dest, exist_ok=True)`.",
      "mentions": [],
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
      "type": "msg"
    },
    {
      "metadata": {
        "model": {
          "id": null,
          "settings": {}
        },
        "to_persona": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
        "settings": {}
      },
      "sender": "st158862",
      "type": "msg",
      "time": 1793218227.1993308,
      "id": "9d2d1389-5209-4a31-b649-eaf08414c643",
      "raw_time": false,
      "body": "how to run it?"
    },
    {
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona",
      "time": 1793218250.0579438,
      "type": "msg",
      "body": "```bash\n# Default: backs up project/ \u2192 backups/\npython3 scripts/backup_project.py\n\n# Custom paths (use My_Project since project/ doesn't exist yet)\npython3 scripts/backup_project.py --source My_Project --backup-dir backups\n```\n\nFirst run succeeds. Second run triggers the bug \u2014 you'll need to debug it for your homework.",
      "mentions": [],
      "id": "7b0835ea-2b5a-481b-a2c3-02c802654662"
    },
    {
      "type": "msg",
